      "tier": 1,
      "title": "Google Cloud SQL 评测：高可用备库不可读",
      "summary": "Christophe Pettus 评测了 Google Cloud SQL。Enterprise 版就是 Google 托管虚拟机里的一个 PostgreSQL 进程；Enterprise Plus 加了一层读缓存，热数据超过 shared_buffers 时能明显降延迟。优点还有 IAM 认证和带执行计划的 Query Insights。限制是高可用备库不可读，扩展走白名单，没有 RDS Proxy 式的托管连接池，磁盘只增不减。",
      "url": "https://thebuild.com/blog/managed-postgres-examined-google-cloud-sql-for-postgresql/",
      "author": "Christophe Pettus",
      "source": "thebuild.com",
      "source_date": "2026-05-12",
      "image": "https://thebuild.com/media/media/26b5298aafd9419a82236c1d2d7c57b3.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "托管服务",
        "Cloud SQL",
        "评测"
      ],
      "position": 1
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "Snowflake、Lakebase、HorizonDB 各自的锁定",
      "summary": "Christophe Pettus 认为选这三家的第一个问题不是引擎强弱，而是团队已经站在哪个数据平台上。Snowflake Postgres 最像原版 PostgreSQL，用开源的 pg_lake 接湖仓。Lakebase 建在 Neon 引擎上，即时分支适合 CI 与时间点恢复。Azure HorizonDB 自研存储只兼容协议，号称三倍吞吐、支持 3072 vCore 与 128 TB。三者都要牺牲扩展与升级节奏。",
      "url": "https://thebuild.com/blog/snowflake-postgres-lakebase-horizondb-picking-the-lock-in-you-want/",
      "author": "Christophe Pettus",
      "source": "thebuild.com",
      "source_date": "2026-05-12",
      "image": "https://thebuild.com/media/media/79875ce29f9f49efab713b13dc31f0a2_f2kg0IJ.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "湖仓",
        "厂商锁定",
        "HorizonDB"
      ],
      "position": 2
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "AWS 用种子 LSN 把 RDS 逻辑复制迁到 Aurora",
      "summary": "从 RDS for PostgreSQL 迁到 Aurora 时，两者存储架构不同，快照恢复后 LSN 会被转换，标准逻辑复制因此建立不起来。AWS 给的办法是先用同一份快照恢复出一个临时 RDS 实例，从中取出正确的种子 LSN，再用它启动复制，原生的发布订阅和 DMS 的 CDC 专用任务两条路都适用。这样可以在多读节点的 Aurora 集群上做真实压测，并在一个维护窗口里同时完成迁移和大版本升级。",
      "url": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/database/migrating-amazon-rds-for-postgresql-to-amazon-aurora-using-seeded-logical-replication/",
      "author": "Russell Swanson",
      "source": "AWS Database Blog",
      "source_date": "2026-05-12",
      "image": "https://d2908q01vomqb2.cloudfront.net/887309d048beef83ad3eabf2a79a64a389ab1c9f/2026/05/08/DB5376.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "迁移",
        "逻辑复制",
        "Aurora"
      ],
      "position": 3
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "hackorum 与 pginbox 合并做邮件列表界面",
      "summary": "pgsql-hackers 的邮件量对新人并不友好，hackorum 和 pginbox 两个团队各自做出了几乎一样的网页界面：论坛式的只读视图，带 commitfest 集成、贡献者档案、已读追踪和团队共享笔记。两边决定合并而不是互相竞争，由 Percona 的 Kai Wagner 和联合创始人 Zsolt 牵头，Jack Bonatakis 加入。目标是让这条高流量列表更好导航。",
      "url": "https://percona.community/blog/2026/05/13/two-projects-one-mission-hackorum-and-pginbox-join-forces/",
      "author": "Kai Wagner",
      "source": "Percona Community",
